abstract: >-
  A portable, offline-first Windows desktop application for internet
  blackouts: connectivity monitoring, a resumable readiness kit, an offline
  Wikipedia (ZIM) and full-text Persian search library, a local GGUF/llama.cpp
  assistant, and encrypted peer-to-peer LAN chat and file transfer.
keywords:
  - offline-first
  - internet blackout
  - Persian
  - RTL
  - PySide6
  - ZIM
  - Kiwix
  - llama.cpp
  - GGUF
  - SQLite FTS5
  - LAN
